#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:3
#: c09ca1d4cc1849d2adc809fbb90771bf
msgid "振动模式扰动（Vib Mode Perturb）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:5
#: 343cba6c8393441bb822016e5efa3081
msgid "**分类：** 扰动"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:7
#: 816adecf1ac748d0966d497c15cd6bf1
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:9
#: 3b747c90b0e64b04b166026ad172658a
msgid ""
"沿声子振动模态方向施加位移扰动，比纯随机扰动更贴近动力学自由度。每个输出结构"
"随机选取若干振动模态，按幅值叠加位移。可选按频率缩放（高频模态贡献更小）和排"
"除近零频模态（避免平移/旋转伪模）。"
msgstr ""
"Displace atoms along phonon eigenvectors so the sampled directions follow "
"dynamical degrees of freedom rather than arbitrary coordinate noise. Each "
"output combines a random subset of modes. Optional frequency scaling reduces "
"the contribution of high-frequency modes, and a near-zero-frequency filter "
"removes translational or rotational artifacts."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:11
#: acd54f4e91644ea7b7a69ae00d5e1688
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:13
#: a2c1895672764fcb900ef3d419e15287
msgid ""
"\\mathbf{r}'=\\mathbf{r}+A\\sum_{k\\in\\mathcal{K}} c_k\\mathbf{u}_k,\\quad "
"c_k\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,1)\\ \\text{or}\\ \\mathcal{U}(-1,1)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:15
#: 32d42343ba444853b81d16a630f33a9a
msgid ""
"$\\mathbf u_k$ 是第 $k$ 个输入振动模态，$\\mathcal K$ 是本样本抽中的模态集"
"合， $A$ 是总幅值尺度。开启频率缩放时，高频模态系数会按频率降低；最小频率门槛"
"用于排除 近零平移/转动伪模。该卡不会自行计算本征模，公式完全依赖输入模态的归"
"一化约定。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:19
#: 183258d77c0f497eb4ba696f0805153a
msgid ""
"**关键前置条件：** 输入结构必须携带振动模态数据。如果来自 EXTXYZ 文件，需要包"
"含 `mode_N_x/y/z` 和 `frequency_N` 列，或者整块数组 `modes` / "
"`vibration_modes` 和 `frequencies` / `vibration_frequencies`。没有模态数据"
"时，卡片返回空结果。"
msgstr ""
"**Required input:** Every input structure must carry vibrational-mode data. "
"An EXTXYZ file may provide `mode_N_x/y/z` and `frequency_N` columns, or "
"block arrays named `modes` / `vibration_modes` and `frequencies` / "
"`vibration_frequencies`. A structure without recognized mode data is "
"skipped, so an all-missing input produces no output."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:21
#: 4abaf5fa8c75458db007e09707b06ce6
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:23
#: abc4fbd341a94e91897aeaa5f28abd59
msgid "场景：加了 Atomic Perturb 后力 MAE 改善有限，低频声子支的预测仍然很差"
msgstr ""
"Scenario: Atomic Perturb improves force MAE only modestly and low-frequency "
"phonon branches remain inaccurate"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:25
#: b14bb8e7816b48b9ac348dbd2556ad18
msgid ""
"你在 Si 上训练了一个 NEP 模型。加了 `Atomic Perturb`（0.2 Å 随机位移）后，力"
"的 MAE 从 150 meV/A 降到了 80 meV/A，但计算出的声子色散在低频声学支上误差仍然"
"很大。诊断发现：纯随机扰动在所有方向上均匀采样，但低频声子对应的是长波长的协"
"同原子运动——纯随机扰动几乎不可能恰好对齐这些方向。"
msgstr ""
"You trained an NEP model for Si. Adding 0.2 Å `Atomic Perturb` samples "
"reduces force MAE from 150 to 80 meV/Å, yet the low-frequency acoustic "
"branches of the predicted phonon dispersion remain inaccurate. Independent "
"random displacements sample generic directions, whereas low-frequency "
"phonons involve collective, long-wavelength motion that random noise is "
"unlikely to align with efficiently."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:27
#: 07cf3820856f476ea74f6f9ae6fb02d4
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 声子频率对位移的灵敏度在各个模态方向上差异巨大。低频声学模涉及"
"大范围原子协同位移，但在局部键长上变化很小——纯随机扰动倾向于产生\"局域键长变"
"化大\"的构型，这恰好是高频光学模的特征，不是低频模的特征。需要沿准确的振动模"
"本征方向施加位移，让模型在模态坐标上也有训练点。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** The energy response differs greatly among normal-mode "
"directions. Low-frequency acoustic modes involve coordinated motion across "
"many atoms while changing local bond lengths only slightly. Independent "
"random perturbations emphasize local bond distortions and therefore cover "
"those collective directions poorly. Displacements along trusted eigenvectors "
"place training samples directly on the relevant normal-mode coordinates."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:29
#: 55ec5dc21ca64bcb829361dd3dd0e88c
msgid ""
"**输入：** 一个 Si 超胞，EXTXYZ 文件已包含 phonopy 计算出的振动模态数据"
"（`mode_1_x/y/z` 到 `mode_N_x/y/z` 和 `frequency_1` 到 `frequency_N`）"
msgstr ""
"**Input:** A Si supercell whose EXTXYZ data include phonopy-derived modes "
"(`mode_1_x/y/z` through `mode_N_x/y/z`) and frequencies (`frequency_1` "
"through `frequency_N`)."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:31
#: 011878ccef9b49498878826aa74e4643
msgid ""
"**目标：** 生成 32 个扰动结构，每次随机选 3 个模态叠加，幅值 0.05，只使用频"
"率 > 10 THz 的模态（或 < 10 的具体看体系）"
msgstr ""
"**Goal:** Generate 32 perturbed structures by combining three randomly "
"selected modes per structure at amplitude 0.05. Choose a frequency threshold "
"appropriate to the system; for example, retain only modes above 10 THz when "
"intentionally targeting that range."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:33
#: 240f3e9b258641869735a0564545deda
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:34
#: 88e580b4e0604624aadbfda3b6a23f2d
msgid "`振动幅度`（`amplitude`） = `0.05`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:35
#: 31f1512921d34ca08ab111d93b4dfb22
msgid "`每个样本的模式数`（`modes_per_sample`） = `3`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:36
#: 8177a68d3f4d46c18f82f811e90c2eaa
msgid "`最大输出数量`（`max_num`） = `32`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:37
#: 48696d3a497a4a18ad239270f9a07b3b
msgid "`最小频率`（`min_frequency`） = `0.0` （或设一个合理的过滤值）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:38
#: b5ae2159a66849548c20cf21cc686ebb
msgid "`分布`（`distribution`） = `0` （高斯分布）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:39
#: 2036ba48080f49b89e7185e17fa8a34f
msgid "`按频率缩放`（`scale_by_frequency`） = `true` （高频模自动衰减）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:41
#: 6c5d76d688ed46eb93ff2fd3eedbdcaf
msgid ""
"**输出：** 32 个结构，每个沿 3 个随机选取的振动模态方向偏移，位移幅值按频率缩"
"放"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** 32 structures displaced along combinations of three randomly "
"selected vibrational modes, with contributions scaled by frequency."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:43
#: 9f357da064964eaf9ca32e4535ec7b19
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:44
#: acd2e5c1d2854ffb9fa778d9e9f471bf
msgid "重训后重新计算声子色散，低频声学支应更接近 DFT 结果"
msgstr ""
"After DFT labeling and retraining, recalculate the phonon dispersion and "
"compare the low-frequency acoustic branches with DFT."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:45
#: cfcb0ac60a96466fa44e39e628daac22
msgid ""
"检查输出中哪些模态被选中——如果低频模态总是被 `最小频率`（`min_frequency`）排"
"除，降低此阈值"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:46
#: ffd15518550c497e9c2207c4dfe0a03a
msgid ""
"如果模型对高频光学支仍然不准，增大 `每个样本的模式数`（`modes_per_sample`）"
"到 4~5，或增大 `最大输出数量`（`max_num`）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:47
#: 70d2a979457247f1b75877be33233348
msgid ""
"如果 `按频率缩放`（`scale_by_frequency`）导致高频模位移太小（几乎看不到变"
"化），关闭此开关试一批"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:49
#: b8fb13f8536e486b9ef9204c8a2c3083
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:51
#: c44d139a9d544f0287d5e01348c45640
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:52
#: c33542045dec4bf1875df1fccfc2909e
msgid "已有可信的振动模态数据，需要沿模态方向补充训练样本"
msgstr ""
"Trusted vibrational-mode data are available and the training set needs "
"samples along those directions."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:53
#: a2e14808bbce411ab1023dc6fa2fe282
msgid "纯随机扰动改进有限，声子或振动相关性质仍有偏差"
msgstr ""
"Random perturbations have provided limited improvement and phonon or "
"vibrational properties remain inaccurate."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:54
#: edf5c29d988e41e4aa0c83678a4e7628
msgid "需要模型学到模态方向上的势能面曲率"
msgstr ""
"The model needs potential-energy curvature information along normal-mode "
"coordinates."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:56
#: 2204e9c7de404874b3b027dbb57c845b
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:57
#: 0cc80e7802224b97a07462ae52b69827
msgid "输入结构没有模态数据——卡片直接返回空，先跑 phonopy/DFPT 生成模态"
msgstr ""
"The input has no mode data. Generate modes with phonopy or DFPT before using "
"this card."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:58
#: fc336dfa9edf4d758959555b46234746
msgid "模态是从低精度方法（如经验势）算出来的——沿错误模态方向扰动只会引入噪声"
msgstr ""
"The modes come from an insufficiently accurate method. Sampling along "
"incorrect eigenvectors may add noise rather than useful coverage."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:59
#: 78df5432643146d79dfda38c43845635
msgid "只需要覆盖高频局域环境——用 `Atomic Perturb` 更简单直接"
msgstr ""
"Only generic high-frequency local distortions are needed → `Atomic Perturb` "
"is simpler."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:61
#: f3546cdded5b49498a7e79abb3272c88
msgid "输入格式：振动模态数据"
msgstr "Input format: vibrational-mode data"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:63
#: d96e37e111ef4387bf31fd4435517710
msgid "输入结构需要以下数组之一（EXTXYZ 格式优先）："
msgstr ""
"The input structure must contain one of the following array layouts. EXTXYZ "
"is recommended."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:65
#: bb55a3e2ede04a8aab068f06e84bcd9a
msgid "**方式一：按模态拆列（推荐，手写最友好）**"
msgstr ""
"**Layout 1: one set of columns per mode (recommended and easiest to write "
"manually)**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:66
#: d206c115d74d4e7b92bcddcc403c48e7
msgid ""
"2\n"
"Properties=species:S:1:pos:R:3:mode_1_x:R:1:mode_1_y:R:1:mode_1_z:R:1:frequency_1:R:1 "
"pbc=\"F F F\"\n"
"H 0.000 0.000 0.000 0.10 0.00 0.00 1500.0\n"
"H 0.740 0.000 0.000 -0.10 0.00 0.00 1500.0\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:72
#: 67425fe5c54b4c60a12a675626bc5b48
msgid ""
"`mode_N_x/y/z`：第 N 个模态在每个原子上的位移分量。`frequency_N`：第 N 个模态"
"的频率，每个原子行重复同一值。"
msgstr ""
"`mode_N_x/y/z` stores the displacement components of mode *N* for each atom. "
"`frequency_N` stores that mode's frequency, repeated on every atomic row."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:74
#: 5e0220ca337b4c19aab7282f62db0316
msgid "**方式二：整块数组（适合多模态）**"
msgstr "**Layout 2: block arrays (convenient for many modes)**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:75
#: 25f7570dccbf426bb6ff3a794237b84d
msgid ""
"2\n"
"Properties=species:S:1:pos:R:3:modes:R:3N:frequencies:R:N pbc=\"F F F\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:79
#: 39ec10a7ec2b4db78e8d4c149e527b74
msgid ""
"`modes:R:3N` 表示 N 个模态的位移分量，按 mode1_xyz + mode2_xyz + ... 顺序。"
"`frequencies:R:N` 表示 N 个频率值，每行重复同一组。"
msgstr ""
"`modes:R:3N` stores the displacement components of *N* modes in `mode1_xyz + "
"mode2_xyz + ...` order. `frequencies:R:N` stores the *N* frequency values, "
"with the same set repeated on each row."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:81
#: 5bc194ff5e1c4cd2b688e1feb728f3f7
msgid ""
"代码接受的键名：`vibration_modes` / `normal_modes` / `modes`，以及 "
"`vibration_frequencies` / `normal_mode_frequencies` / `frequencies` / "
"`freqs`。列名或形状不对时，卡片将该结构视为\"没有可用模态\"并跳过。"
msgstr ""
"Accepted mode keys are `vibration_modes`, `normal_modes`, and `modes`; "
"accepted frequency keys are `vibration_frequencies`, "
"`normal_mode_frequencies`, `frequencies`, and `freqs`. A structure with "
"unrecognized names or incompatible shapes is treated as having no usable "
"modes and is skipped."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:83
#: edcaac11ff464ae0bbedcfbbd92be962
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:85
#: 585d58600c4c41e28ff2cf1076e8a989
msgid "分布（distribution）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:87
#: fde80a36c06a400d83f3bda1c25984e3
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 0。模态系数的采样分布。`0` = 高斯（均值 0，大幅位移概率更低，更接"
"近热振动统计）；`1` = 均匀。通常高斯更物理——你不希望模型被极端大位移的训练点"
"带偏。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default: `0`. Distribution used to sample mode coefficients. `0` is a "
"zero-mean Gaussian, which makes extreme amplitudes less likely; `1` is "
"uniform. Gaussian sampling is usually the safer thermal-like default."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:89
#: 3a7318500aa341cfb8adaf7833f7aa65
msgid "振动幅度（amplitude）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:91
#: a841c6f30c30421eb6d828f99d1fc37e
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 `0.05`。模态叠加的总幅值系数，实际位移 = `amplitude * "
"sum(coefficient * mode_vector)`。注意这个幅值是乘在归一化后的模态矢量上的——如"
"果上游的模态归一化方式不同（mass-weighted vs. 不归一化），同样的 amplitude 产"
"生的实际原子位移也不一样。0.01~0.03 适合微扰验证；0.05~0.08 常规补充；设到 "
"0.1 以上建议后筛检查最近邻距离。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `0.05`. Overall coefficient in `displacement = amplitude * "
"sum(coefficient * mode_vector)`. The actual atomic displacement also depends "
"on how the upstream mode vectors were normalized, including whether they are "
"mass weighted. Use 0.01–0.03 for small-displacement checks and 0.05–0.08 for "
"routine augmentation. Above 0.1, validate nearest-neighbor distances "
"carefully."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:93
#: 9e2c857afee5475daa1807f60282b482
msgid "每个样本的模式数（modes_per_sample）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:95
#: a5b7f7c26ea54e6783dda0b2585b31fc
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 2。每个输出结构随机选几个模态来叠加。1~2 个适合单模态方向验证，能"
"清楚看到每个模态的贡献；3~4 个做多模态混合覆盖；5 个以上单个模态的贡献会被稀"
"释，而且组合数指数增长——通常 2~4 就够了。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default: `2`. Number of randomly selected modes combined in each "
"output. Use 1–2 to inspect individual-mode behavior and 3–4 for mixed-mode "
"coverage. Above 5, each mode's contribution becomes harder to interpret and "
"the combinatorial space grows rapidly; 2–4 is usually sufficient."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:97
#: 8109e007260346d1b25fbc684801967a
msgid "最小频率（min_frequency）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:99
#: b181556098924e75b30663a662dcf38d
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 `10.0`。频率低于这个值的模态不参与采样。仅在 "
"`exclude_near_zero=true` 时生效。设 0 则不过滤。典型值：排除平移/旋转伪模设 "
"0.1~1.0 THz；排除软模设 1~10 THz，具体看你的体系。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `10.0`. Modes below this frequency are excluded when "
"`exclude_near_zero=true`; use 0 to disable thresholding. A 0.1–1.0 THz "
"threshold can remove translational or rotational artifacts, while 1–10 THz "
"also removes soft modes. Choose the value from the calculated spectrum and "
"the physics you intend to retain."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:101
#: 65f5835baf94416e9af6eb0d69d6546a
msgid "最大输出数量（max_num）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:103
#: bbb36e2d954840689c16159523eb154a
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 32。每个输入结构生成多少个扰动样本。20~40 常规覆盖，50~100 高密度"
"覆盖。建议后面接一张 `FPS Filter` 去重。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default: `32`. Number of perturbed samples generated per input "
"structure. Use 20–40 for routine coverage and 50–100 for denser sampling. "
"Follow large batches with `FPS Filter` to reduce redundancy."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:105
#: fb659f2503394b348331d4dca5d79e76
msgid "按频率缩放（scale_by_frequency）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:107
#: d6d53c3a00034146bdaa2f3fb587e0ad
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `true`。打开后每个模态系数除以 sqrt(frequency)，高频模态的贡献自"
"动衰减。这是物理上更合理的设置——同样的位移幅值，高频模态需要的能量远大于低频"
"模。如果你在研究大位移的非谐效应，可以临时关掉，但注意关掉后高频模方向可能被"
"过度采样，建议同时降低 `振动幅度`（`amplitude`）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:109
#: dd163ea808354b67bd3ef32ac8fd64c4
msgid "排除近零频率（exclude_near_zero）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:111
#: 715c6d76261847c682c60f56d4a1d825
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `true`。打开后用 `最小频率`（`min_frequency`）做阈值过滤，排除近"
"零频模态。一般建议保持打开——平移和旋转伪模的频率接近 0，沿这些\"模态\"做位移"
"会产生异常大的整体漂移。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:113
#: 325021f2d8754ee7948db9c339f1d3f5
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:115
#: 1bd197199d28461a86a2ecbf7336fb9f
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `false`。打开后每次同一输入 + 同一参数 + 同一 seed 得到完全相同"
"的扰动结果。对比实验或需要复现时打开，纯探索阶段可以关着。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default: `false`. Enable it to reproduce exactly the same "
"perturbations from the same input, parameters, and seed. Use it for "
"controlled comparisons; leave it off during exploratory sampling."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:117
#: 1e01705a747246e18921932e46fa9649
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:119
#: 63173b463ba74105ab9fc883f4c85e0d
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 0。随机种子值。仅在 `使用随机种子`（`use_seed`）打开时生效。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:121
#: f9ba318e70e046a3baa90b5f903458d6
msgid "生效条件：`use_seed=True`。"
msgstr "Active only when `use_seed=True`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:123
#: 3b18b0cf1956421da4c04e6ca568f284
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:125
#: b72afc914315448793137dd57b0be89e
msgid "微扰验证（幅值 0.02，2 模态，20 样本，高斯）"
msgstr ""
"Small-displacement check (amplitude 0.02, 2 modes, 20 Gaussian samples)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:126
#: e3348713952b4f04a19b286f63af8582
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"VibrationModePerturbCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"distribution\": 0,\n"
"    \"amplitude\": 0.02,\n"
"    \"modes_per_sample\": 2,\n"
"    \"min_frequency\": 0.1,\n"
"    \"max_num\": 20,\n"
"    \"scale_by_frequency\": true,\n"
"    \"exclude_near_zero\": true,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:144
#: 52396f013d394599ba58feb6e05e030d
msgid "常规声子覆盖（幅值 0.05，3 模态，32 样本，高斯）"
msgstr "Routine phonon coverage (amplitude 0.05, 3 modes, 32 Gaussian samples)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:145
#: 0387a287557b48a7ab3dcc9811593f2c
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"VibrationModePerturbCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"distribution\": 0,\n"
"    \"amplitude\": 0.05,\n"
"    \"modes_per_sample\": 3,\n"
"    \"min_frequency\": 0.1,\n"
"    \"max_num\": 32,\n"
"    \"scale_by_frequency\": true,\n"
"    \"exclude_near_zero\": true,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:163
#: 6ed5907f327c49f784e8350b089b0b07
msgid "大位移非谐探索（幅值 0.1，5 模态，50 样本，不缩放）"
msgstr ""
"Large-displacement anharmonic exploration (amplitude 0.1, 5 modes, 50 "
"samples, no frequency scaling)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:164
#: f133e72e159d4cafa43c11af0eb5e362
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"VibrationModePerturbCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"distribution\": 1,\n"
"    \"amplitude\": 0.1,\n"
"    \"modes_per_sample\": 5,\n"
"    \"min_frequency\": 0.0,\n"
"    \"max_num\": 50,\n"
"    \"scale_by_frequency\": false,\n"
"    \"exclude_near_zero\": false,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:182
#: f807ad0e7b2441a0912cffdb0210b262
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:184
#: 70d009b12c6e4708b1ffe617eef460ee
msgid ""
"`Vib Mode Perturb` → `Atomic Perturb`：先沿模态方向扰动，再补充纯随机方向"
msgstr ""
"`Vib Mode Perturb` → `Atomic Perturb`: sample normal-mode directions, then "
"add generic random directions."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:185
#: 4c7964d934414f5786cf0205d11fa993
msgid ""
"`phonopy/DFPT` 生成模态 → `Vib Mode Perturb`：计算完模态后直接喂入生成训练数"
"据"
msgstr ""
"`phonopy/DFPT` modes → `Vib Mode Perturb`: calculate trusted modes, attach "
"them to the structures, then generate training candidates."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:186
#: f98700703eae455a8f9f1f35d9c25b7d
msgid "`Vib Mode Perturb` → `FPS Filter`：大批量生成后去重"
msgstr ""
"`Vib Mode Perturb` → `FPS Filter`: reduce redundancy after large-scale "
"generation."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:188
#: 17e4118573ed44df8f8a3271fdc63255
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:190
#: 631b4279d7ad4c29838c94ce891e1ea5
msgid ""
"**输出为空（无结构生成）。** 输入结构没有可识别的模态数据。检查：列名是否正确"
"（`mode_1_x` 不是 `mode1_x`），频率列是否存在且命名正确，数组形状是否和原子数"
"一致。可以用 ASE 读取 EXTXYZ 文件后查看 `arrays` 确认键名。"
msgstr ""
"**No structures are produced.** The input contains no recognized mode data. "
"Check that columns use names such as `mode_1_x`, not `mode1_x`; verify the "
"frequency columns and ensure every array shape matches the atom count. "
"Reading the EXTXYZ with ASE and inspecting `arrays` is a direct way to "
"confirm the keys."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:192
#: 6eb976697f3f4ff1bb0c7c1df74b0531
msgid ""
"**部分模态始终没被选中。** 这是随机采样的正常现象。`每个样本的模式数`"
"（`modes_per_sample`）较小时（1~2），样本数不够覆盖所有模态。增大 `最大输出数"
"量`（`max_num`）或 `每个样本的模式数`（`modes_per_sample`）提高覆盖率。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:194
#: 9b93d52db11d4d6fa2ccfc1244a5b739
msgid ""
"**关闭 `按频率缩放`（`scale_by_frequency`）后高频模位移过大。** 这是预期行为"
"——`1/sqrt(frequency)` 的缩放会显著衰减高频贡献。需要研究高频非谐效应时关闭，"
"但注意高频模方向上的大幅位移很容易进入非物理区。建议关闭后降低 `振动幅度`"
"（`amplitude`）补偿。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:196
#: 586712af736448fd8793021252a4f5b6
msgid ""
"**`最小频率`（`min_frequency`）过滤后模态太少。** 如果体系存在大量软模（近零"
"频），高阶阈值会把模态池缩到很小。先检查软模是否物理（有可能是没弛豫好），然"
"后适当降低 `最小频率`（`min_frequency`）或关闭 `排除近零频率`"
"（`exclude_near_zero`）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:198
#: 4d5d83a38a9148e5b4f1658c9f12f8e1
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:200
#: a4219bac1c554dc696630cc14ccf712f
msgid "`Vib(a={amplitude},m={modes_per_sample})`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:202
#: 069ab832946945fbbf207b385ab13808
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vibration-perturb-card.md:204
#: aaf21b3b4ee64c2aa8a21c7007376039
msgid ""
"勾选 `使用随机种子`（`use_seed`） + 固定 `随机种子`（`seed`） → 相同输入可复"
"现。模态选择、系数采样均受 seed 控制。"
msgstr ""

#~ msgid "振动模态扰动（Vib Mode Perturb）"
#~ msgstr "Vibrational-Mode Perturbation (Vib Mode Perturb)"

#~ msgid "`min_frequency` = `0.0` （或设一个合理的过滤值）"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`min_frequency` = `0.0`, or a physically justified filtering threshold"

#~ msgid "`distribution` = `0` （高斯分布）"
#~ msgstr "`distribution` = `0` (Gaussian)"

#~ msgid "`scale_by_frequency` = `true` （高频模自动衰减）"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`scale_by_frequency` = `true` (automatically attenuate high-frequency "
#~ "modes)"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "检查输出中哪些模态被选中——如果低频模态总是被 `min_frequency` 排除，降低此"
#~ "阈值"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Inspect which modes were selected. If relevant low-frequency modes are "
#~ "excluded by `min_frequency`, lower the threshold."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "如果模型对高频光学支仍然不准，增大 `modes_per_sample` 到 4~5，或增大 "
#~ "`max_num`"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If high-frequency optical branches remain inaccurate, increase "
#~ "`modes_per_sample` to 4–5 or raise `max_num`, then verify that the added "
#~ "samples cover the intended modes."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "如果 `scale_by_frequency` 导致高频模位移太小（几乎看不到变化），关闭此开关"
#~ "试一批"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If `scale_by_frequency` makes high-frequency displacements negligibly "
#~ "small, generate a controlled comparison with scaling disabled and a "
#~ "correspondingly reduced amplitude."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`bool`，默认 `true`。打开后每个模态系数除以 sqrt(frequency)，高频模态的贡"
#~ "献自动衰减。这是物理上更合理的设置——同样的位移幅值，高频模态需要的能量远大"
#~ "于低频模。如果你在研究大位移的非谐效应，可以临时关掉，但注意关掉后高频模方"
#~ "向可能被过度采样，建议同时降低 `amplitude`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default: `true`. Divides each mode coefficient by "
#~ "`sqrt(frequency)`, attenuating high-frequency contributions. This is a "
#~ "useful thermal-like default because high-frequency modes are "
#~ "energetically expensive at equal displacement. When intentionally "
#~ "studying large-amplitude anharmonicity, you may disable it, but reduce "
#~ "`amplitude` to avoid over-sampling high-frequency directions."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`bool`，默认 `true`。打开后用 `min_frequency` 做阈值过滤，排除近零频模态。"
#~ "一般建议保持打开——平移和旋转伪模的频率接近 0，沿这些\"模态\"做位移会产生异"
#~ "常大的整体漂移。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default: `true`. Applies `min_frequency` to remove near-zero "
#~ "modes. Keep it enabled in most workflows because translational and "
#~ "rotational artifacts lie near zero frequency and can produce large rigid-"
#~ "body drift."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 0。随机种子值。仅在 `use_seed` 打开时生效。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default: `0`. Random seed used only when `use_seed` is enabled."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**部分模态始终没被选中。** 这是随机采样的正常现象。`modes_per_sample` 较小"
#~ "时（1~2），样本数不够覆盖所有模态。增大 `max_num` 或 `modes_per_sample` 提"
#~ "高覆盖率。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Some modes are never selected.** This is expected in finite random "
#~ "sampling. With `modes_per_sample` of 1–2, the sample count may be too "
#~ "small to cover the full pool. Increase `max_num` or `modes_per_sample` "
#~ "and inspect the resulting coverage."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**关闭 `scale_by_frequency` 后高频模位移过大。** 这是预期行为——`1/"
#~ "sqrt(frequency)` 的缩放会显著衰减高频贡献。需要研究高频非谐效应时关闭，但"
#~ "注意高频模方向上的大幅位移很容易进入非物理区。建议关闭后降低 `amplitude` "
#~ "补偿。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**High-frequency displacements become too large after disabling "
#~ "`scale_by_frequency`.** This is expected because `1/sqrt(frequency)` "
#~ "normally attenuates them. Disable scaling only for a deliberate high-"
#~ "frequency anharmonic study, and compensate by lowering `amplitude` while "
#~ "validating geometry."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**`min_frequency` 过滤后模态太少。** 如果体系存在大量软模（近零频），高阶"
#~ "阈值会把模态池缩到很小。先检查软模是否物理（有可能是没弛豫好），然后适当降"
#~ "低 `min_frequency` 或关闭 `exclude_near_zero`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Too few modes remain after `min_frequency` filtering.** A system with "
#~ "many soft modes can be left with a very small pool. First determine "
#~ "whether the soft modes are physical or indicate incomplete relaxation, "
#~ "then lower `min_frequency` or disable `exclude_near_zero` only when "
#~ "justified."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "勾选 `use_seed` + 固定 `seed` → 相同输入可复现。模态选择、系数采样均受 "
#~ "seed 控制。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Enable `use_seed` and fix `seed` to reproduce the same result for the "
#~ "same input. The seed controls both mode selection and coefficient "
#~ "sampling."
